      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the woman in the intimate scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the woman depicted in the visual material, as she is the direct subject of the textual stereotype ('she's dyslexic'). The meme implies that the user (as a viewer or participant in the scenario) is identifying with or imagining themselves in the position of the woman, who is being stereotyped as having dyslexia and thus being more sexually available. This projection is implicit through the framing of the text and the visual context, where the woman is the focal point of the stereotype.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
